# Gitignored: the API-only push path cannot commit binary blobs. This
# parquet regenerates deterministically from the committed per-year CSVs in
# pjm-outages/by-year/ (or the raw pull) via
# scripts/data/derive_pjm_dam_availability.py.
pjm-dam-availability.parquet

# NYISO day-ahead ATC/TTC postings (nyiso-134, 2026-08-14). Not committed, for
# the same reason the legacy ATC_TTC.zip never was: NYISO's redistribution terms
# are unverified (docs/data-licensing.md §7), and it is ~17 MB of raw zips whose
# only product is the small Central-East constants block in config/constants.py.
# scripts/data/derive_nyiso_central_east_ttc.py reads this directory when present
# and prints the exact per-month re-fetch command when it is absent, so the
# derivation stays fully reproducible from a bare checkout.
NYISO/atc-ttc/
